.ai/issues/refine/ISSUE-019-parallel-multiple-goals.md:15:Goal: Design support for multiple goals that can run sequentially or in parallel as multiple Pi agents, optionally with one worktree per goal.
.ai/issues/refine/ISSUE-019-parallel-multiple-goals.md:19:The first version intentionally supports one branch-local goal. Larger workflows may require several independent goals: parallel investigation paths, sequential release checklist goals, or multiple implementation shards. This cannot be bolted on casually because state, UI, continuation, budgets, and worktree ownership all become multi-tenant.
