.ai/issues/refine/ISSUE-019-parallel-multiple-goals.md:24:- Sequential mode: one active goal runs at a time; next begins when previous completes or pauses.
.ai/issues/refine/ISSUE-019-parallel-multiple-goals.md:25:- Parallel mode: multiple Pi agents pursue goals concurrently, optionally isolated by worktree.
.ai/issues/refine/ISSUE-019-parallel-multiple-goals.md:26:- UI shows aggregate status plus current/selected goal details.
